<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="et">
<head>
	<meta charset="utf-8">
	<title>Marie Abel, veevbiprogrammeerimine</title>
</head>
<body>
	<img src="pic/veebiprogrammeerimine_2026_TA.png" alt="">
	<h1>Marie Abel, veebiprogrammeerimine</h1>
	<h2><b>Eesti filmi lisamine</b></h2>
	<p>Siin lehel saab andmebaasi lisada Eesti filme.</p>
	<ul>
		<li><a href="/">Tagasi avalehele</a></li>
		<li><a href="/eestifilm">Eesti film</a></li>
	</ul>
	<hr>
	<form method="POST" action="/eestifilm/filmid_add">
		<label for="titleInput">Filmi pealkiri</label>
		<input id="titleInput" name="titleInput" type="text" placeholder="Filmi pealkiri" value="<%= titleInput %>" required>
		<br>
		<label for="yearInput">Linastumisaasta</label>
		<input id="yearInput" name="yearInput" type="number" value="<%= yearInput %>" required>
		<br>
		<label for="durationInput">Kestus minutites</label>
		<input id="durationInput" name="durationInput" type="number" value="<%= durationInput %>" required>
		<br>
		<label for="descriptionInput">Filmi kirjeldus</label>
		<textarea id="descriptionInput" name="descriptionInput"><%= descriptionInput %></textarea>
		<br>
		<input type="submit" value="Salvesta">
	</form>
	<p>
		<%= notice %>
	</p>
</body>
</html>